@startuml
' Figure 9.6  A wait for a human lasting a week
' Reading order: top to bottom from filed to granted or expired; a
' restart leaves the state where it was.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
state Filed <<ops>>
state Waiting <<ops>>
state Reminded <<org>>
state Escalated <<org>>
state Granted <<verified>>
state Expired <<fail>>
[*] --> Filed
Filed --> Waiting
Waiting --> Reminded : 24 h, 72 h
Reminded --> Waiting
Waiting --> Escalated : day 5
Escalated --> Waiting
Waiting --> Granted : answer
Waiting --> Expired : day 7
Granted --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
@enduml
